Initiative: UNICEF</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.unicef.org/programme/breastfeeding/baby.htm"/></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Assessment of status of IYCF: Practice, Policy and Program: achievements and gaps</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.bpni.org/IYCF-BFHI.html"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>